  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日までいろんな場数は踏んできたけど、\nその中でも一番デカいステージだからな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "っていうか、突っ込まれたら余計に緊張するだろ。\nコーヒー淹れた恩を仇で返すなよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "す、すみません。\n口に出したほうが楽になるかと思ったんですが。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大丈夫だって、秀。俺も緊張してるからさ。けど、\nそれ以上にライブが始まるのが楽しみなんだよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わかるっス、天道さん。\nここに来るまで、みんなで頑張ってきたっスから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "身につけた力を、思う存分ステージにぶつけられる。\nそう思ったら、ワクワクしてくるぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ボクも、ボクも！　\n今日まで、みんなでたくさんのこと、頑張った！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "CDショップで、一日店長した。\n店内放送のお仕事で、言葉もいっぱい勉強した！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの仕事で俺たちを知って、\nファンになったって言ってくれた人もいたよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どれも、コンビニで働いてた頃の\n俺に言ったって、信じないだろうな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_c:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 22,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの時、ボクたち、みんなを笑顔にできた。\nだから今日も、ライブで、いっぱい笑顔、できる！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
